### Login
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "test@test.com",
  "password": "Test123!"
}

> {% client.global.set("token", response.body.accessToken); %}

### Who am I (protected)
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/me
//Authorization: Bearer {{token}}